  funding-text = {The authors are grateful to all members of the AIDA staff for their continuous support during the numerous successful measurement campaigns on ice nucleation which have been conducted at the chamber facility in the past decade. We thank Julian Skrotzki and Volker Ebert for the data analysis of the TDL system. The work has been funded by the Helmholtz-Gemeinschaft deutscher Forschungszentren as part of the program ``Atmosphere and Climate{''}.},
