  funding-acknowledgement = {Helmholtz-Gemeinschaft Deutscher Forschungszentren: Program Atmosphere and Climate; Helmholtz-Gemeinschaft Deutscher Forschungszentren as part of the program ``Atmosphere and Climate {[}CLOUD-MOTION, 764991]; EU {[}CLOUD-16, 01LK1601C]; German Federal Ministry of Education and Research},
